Contract:
REQUEST: Email the AP lead a list of all unpaid bills with their amounts and due dates.
INTENDED OUTCOME: The user wants an email sent to the AP lead (Priya Nair) containing a complete list of all currently unpaid bills from the ERP, showing each 
bill's amount and due date. This is a read-only reporting task; no bill entry or payment scheduling is requested.
